    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Game Overview**  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work is a short third-person perspective visual novel.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will read the story through mouse clicks, while enjoying the illustrations and music.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Story Introduction**  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this winter noon, the protagonist Su Mingxin meets her childhood friend Zhou Ying again.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some indescribable emotions are rekindled in her heart.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She wants to see him, to have him stay by her side.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though she knows this is ultimately impossible.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Plot Summary**  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Mingxin, I'm back.&quot;  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After two years, she finally sees that familiar face again.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course she knows - he didn't return for her sake.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rather, this might be the last chance for them to sit and talk together.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has no intention of changing anything. If such an opportunity truly existed, she would have probably turned this possibility into reality long ago.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Be sure to invite me to your wedding next year.&quot;  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She doesn't want to bid farewell like this, as if all their past was just meaningless events.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;It doesn't matter. As long as he can be happy, that's enough.&quot;  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Operation Guide**  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In dialogue interface:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Swipe mouse upward to top to open dropdown list  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Right-click to enter menu interface  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Feedback**  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bilibili: @\u7075\u865a\u4e4b\u5e7d  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ Group: 901140212</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Game Overview**  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work is a short third-person perspective visual novel.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will read the story through mouse clicks, while enjoying the illustrations and music.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Story Introduction**  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this winter noon, the protagonist Su Mingxin meets her childhood friend Zhou Ying again.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some indescribable emotions are rekindled in her heart.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She wants to see him, to have him stay by her side.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though she knows this is ultimately impossible.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Plot Summary**  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Mingxin, I'm back.&quot;  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After two years, she finally sees that familiar face again.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course she knows - he didn't return for her sake.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rather, this might be the last chance for them to sit and talk together.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has no intention of changing anything. If such an opportunity truly existed, she would have probably turned this possibility into reality long ago.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Be sure to invite me to your wedding next year.&quot;  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She doesn't want to bid farewell like this, as if all their past was just meaningless events.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;It doesn't matter. As long as he can be happy, that's enough.&quot;  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Operation Guide**  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In dialogue interface:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Swipe mouse upward to top to open dropdown list  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Right-click to enter menu interface  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Feedback**  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bilibili: @\u7075\u865a\u4e4b\u5e7d  </p><p c